   150	     * Merges in all the mapping options configured, giving the already defined options precedence.
   151	     *
   152	     * @param sourceMethod the method which inherits the options.
   153	     * @param templateMethod the template method with the options to inherit, may be {@code null}
   154	     * @param isInverse if {@code true}, the specified options are from an inverse method
   155	     * @param annotationMirror the annotation on which the compile errors will be shown.
